# optional native audio module (rust/, built via `npm run native:build`):
# the compiled binary drops into resources/native/, and cargo's build output
# (rust/target/) is large and machine-local — only the .node artifact is
# ignored so the Cargo.toml / src stay in the repo.
resources/native/*.node
rust/target/

